# Everything above is regenerable by the scripts in README, and normally
# gitignored so this stays a data-engineering repo rather than a data dump.
# The exceptions below are committed anyway because the Streamlit app
# deployed at share.streamlit.io reads them directly at runtime, with no
# build step to regenerate them in the cloud — the app would otherwise
# fail on first load. Kept to the minimum the app actually reads (see
# app/data_loader.py); redundant CSV twins of the parquet files and the
# Tableau/Power BI-only BI-export tables stay gitignored.
!data/processed/matches.parquet
!data/processed/deliveries.parquet
!data/processed/players.parquet
!data/processed/batting_stats.csv
!data/processed/bowling_stats.csv
!data/processed/team_stats.csv
!data/processed/venue_stats.csv
!data/processed/player_photos.csv
!data/processed/venue_photos.csv
!data/processed/dismissal_breakdown.csv
!data/features/win_prediction_features.parquet
!models/win_probability.pkl
!models/player_performance.pkl

.DS_Store
*.log

.streamlit/secrets.toml
